abstract: >-
  A research package containing Lean 4 proofs of the admissible odd- and
  even-degree zero-sum-subspace results, complete-build and axiom-audit
  records, a bilingual formalization paper, and a separate proof-candidate
  manuscript whose specific geometric/cohomological route remains under
  formalization and independent review.
